      "basis": "Each constant is 1.25 x the largest value measured over every overlapped generated-schedule run on the validated_for hosts, rounded up to 1 MiB, so the envelope's own margin is 1.0. The schedule generates, compiles, loads and warms both Pocket sidecars in the background (one Core ML job at a time) while ggml FlowLM and Mimi keep working: the prepare charge (generation_peak_bytes + 8 MiB + compile_peak_bytes) covers this stage's prepare over the footprint just before it began, and load_peak_bytes its load and warm-up over the footprint just before the load. The two templates' resident parts (weights, 2 x I/O and the step's KV state, workspace 0) together cover 1.25 x the largest steady state with both sidecars running, over the footprint just before the first load (136314880 bytes): the step's weights on the GPU and the decoder's on the Neural Engine stay below their weight.bin sizes in this process. ane_compile_reserve_bytes is 1.25 x ANECompilerService's largest absolute size while the decoder loaded on the Neural Engine: no run found the service clean (every baseline held 62-67 MiB), so its growth (at most 24.6 MiB) understates a cold compile."
